out.push(h2('9.4  Answering an objection without conceding the finding'));
out.push(S('Stage 1 · Get ready'));
out.push(A('**a** Open. ⚠ **Three answers only, and count them: withdrew it, defended it, ignored it.** **In most classes six or seven of the ten withdrew something**, and in about half of those the finding did not depend on the thing withdrawn. **Do not say the second half at Stage 1** — **it is the finding of the cycle and it arrives at 4a, from the students\' own arithmetic.**'));
out.push(A('**b** Answer without conceding: **2** and **3**. ⚠ **Not 1**, which concedes the finding; **not 4**, which concedes nothing and reasons nothing; **not 5**, where _nonetheless robust_ is an assertion standing where a reason should be. **2 and 3 both carry the clause that does the work** — _which does not depend on_ — **and without that clause the second sentence only repeats the finding.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 2 · Listen and read'));
out.push(A('**a** **B** — **concede exactly what is right and then show what the finding does not depend on**, because most objections are right about the method and silent about the result.'));
out.push(A('**b** **1** ⚠ **She withdrew the paragraph and the figure with it**, and three weeks later found that the finding was nine of the eleven queries, which is a count: **the officer\'s objection was about a rate and she had never claimed a rate.**   **2** **Name the finding and say what it does not depend on** — **and without that second sentence the concession is read as a concession of everything near it.**'));
out.push(NOTE('⚠ **The forty-second test is the cycle and it must be done in writing, with a pen, at Stage 4a.** **Write the finding out with the objected-to thing removed and see whether it still stands.** **One line.** **If it stands, the objection does not reach the finding.** **Students will say they can do it in their heads and they cannot**, because conceding feels like good manners and the head is where the manners live. ⚠ **Then protect the honest half or the technique becomes a trick.** **About half the objections brought to this class have turned out to reach the finding**, and the answer there is one line — _this is admitted and the finding has been removed_ — **with no explanation and no weaker version of the same sentence put in its place.** **The samples in this key concede the method every time and admit one objection outright.**'));
out.push(S('Language box · Practise'));
out.push(A('**1** _You are right that one month is a short period. The finding is nine of the eleven queries, which does not depend on the length of the month._   **2** _You are right that the probe may read high. The finding is that four of the twelve certificates are missing, which does not depend on any reading._   **3** ⚠ _This is admitted and the finding has been removed._ **One line.**   **4** _You are right that the staffing share is a third of the budget. The finding is that three districts are unreached, which does not depend on the share._   **5** **Open, and the answer is a number: in this class between one and nine weeks every time.**'));
