out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards reach the finding** — ⚠ **an undefined word _is_ the finding, a date cannot be had from two dates, an unseen log is the whole of the roller claim, and an undescribed search is the whole of a no-comparable-study claim** — **and the answer on those is one line and no explanation.** **Rows 1, 3 and 5 are objections about rates where the findings are counts**, and the second sentence writes itself once the test has been done on paper.'));
