out.push(A('**2** **Because the finding is a count of the eleven queries and not a rate of anything**, and a count does not depend on the length of the month. **She also corrects the paragraph anyway: the denominator now sits in the same sentence as the count, and the words _the printed route is the problem_ have gone.**'));
