out.push(A('**a** Open. ⚠ **Two numbers and nothing else: points sent, points accepted.** **In most classes the two numbers are the same in seven of the ten** — **everything accepted** — **and in this class two of those seven went to a third round.** **Write the pairs and let the column of identical pairs stand for a moment before anybody says anything about it.**'));
