out.push(A('⚠ **Part 3 at C1 asks for three things at once and candidates lose marks on the third.** **The right root, the right part of speech, and the right number or prefix.** **Item 7 is a plural** — _one or two **discrepancies**_ — **and a candidate who writes DISCREPANCY has done two-thirds of the work and scores nothing.** **Items 2 and 8 need a negative prefix that nothing in the gap announces**: _an objection is **unwarranted** where it asks for something the record cannot supply_, and _very little can be settled **unconditionally**_. **The instruction to drill is mechanical: read the whole sentence after writing the word**, which catches the number and the prefix and takes four seconds.'));
